{%- comment -%}
  pp-ambient-motion
  A site-wide layer of slow-drifting, twinkling sparks, rendered once from
  layout/theme.liquid so every page (not just sections with their own hero
  art) feels a little alive.

  v2: replaced the original large blurred colour-blob circles (looked like
  flat static "spots" rather than motion) with small, crisp sparkle glyphs
  — the same ✦ mark already used in the header marquee, so it reads as a
  deliberate brand touch rather than decoration bolted on. Each one drifts,
  rotates slightly and twinkles (fades in/out), which is what actually
  registers as "moving" at a glance rather than a coloured dot sitting in
  the margin.

  Deliberately kept out of the readable content column: the sparks live in
  the empty side margins outside --page (the boxed content width), so they
  never sit on top of text, images, or buttons and can't affect layout,
  contrast, or existing design. On narrower viewports, where there is no
  visible margin, they simply don't show — nothing to disable per device.

  Fully covered by the existing motion switches already wired up in
  layout/theme.liquid: settings.enable_animations (adds body.pp-motion-off,
  which forces animation:none on every element) and prefers-reduced-motion
  (handled below directly, since this snippet's keyframes are self-contained).
  This snippet also keeps its own theme-setting gate on top
  (settings.enable_ambient_motion) so a merchant can turn off just the
  ambient sparks while keeping hover/reveal motion elsewhere.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if settings.enable_ambient_motion -%}
  <div class="pp-ambient" aria-hidden="true" data-ambient-motion>
    <span class="pp-ambient__rail pp-ambient__rail--left">
      <span class="pp-ambient__spark pp-ambient__spark--1">✦</span>
      <span class="pp-ambient__spark pp-ambient__spark--2">✦</span>
      <span class="pp-ambient__spark pp-ambient__spark--3">✦</span>
    </span>
    <span class="pp-ambient__rail pp-ambient__rail--right">
      <span class="pp-ambient__spark pp-ambient__spark--4">✦</span>
      <span class="pp-ambient__spark pp-ambient__spark--5">✦</span>
      <span class="pp-ambient__spark pp-ambient__spark--6">✦</span>
    </span>
  </div>

  <style>
    .pp-ambient {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 1;
      pointer-events: none;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .pp-ambient__rail {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      width: max(0px, calc((100vw - var(--page)) / 2));
      height: 100%;
    }
    .pp-ambient__rail--left { left: 0; }
    .pp-ambient__rail--right { right: 0; }

    .pp-ambient__spark {
      position: absolute;
      display: block;
      line-height: 1;
      will-change: transform, opacity;
      transform: translate3d(0, var(--pp-scroll-shift, 0px), 0);
    }

    .pp-ambient__spark--1 { left: 24%; top: 12vh;  font-size: 20px; color: var(--green);   animation: pp-ambient-float-a 9s   ease-in-out infinite, pp-ambient-twinkle 4.5s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .pp-ambient__spark--2 { left: 44%; top: 42vh;  font-size: 14px; color: var(--pink);    animation: pp-ambient-float-b 11s  ease-in-out infinite, pp-ambient-twinkle 5.5s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: -2s, -1s; }
    .pp-ambient__spark--3 { left: 30%; top: 72vh;  font-size: 24px; color: var(--purple2); animation: pp-ambient-float-a 12.5s ease-in-out infinite, pp-ambient-twinkle 6s   ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: -5s, -3s; }
    .pp-ambient__spark--4 { right: 28%; top: 18vh; font-size: 16px; color: var(--orange);  animation: pp-ambient-float-b 10s  ease-in-out infinite, pp-ambient-twinkle 5s   ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: -1s, -2s; }
    .pp-ambient__spark--5 { right: 40%; top: 48vh; font-size: 22px; color: var(--green);   animation: pp-ambient-float-a 13s  ease-in-out infinite, pp-ambient-twinkle 4s   ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: -7s, -2.5s; }
    .pp-ambient__spark--6 { right: 22%; top: 78vh; font-size: 15px; color: var(--pink);    animation: pp-ambient-float-b 9.5s ease-in-out infinite, pp-ambient-twinkle 5.2s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: -3s, -1.5s; }

    @keyframes pp-ambient-float-a {
      0%, 100% { transform: translate3d(0, var(--pp-scroll-shift, 0px), 0) rotate(0deg); }
      50%      { transform: translate3d(8px, calc(var(--pp-scroll-shift, 0px) - 26px), 0) rotate(16deg); }
    }
    @keyframes pp-ambient-float-b {
      0%, 100% { transform: translate3d(0, var(--pp-scroll-shift, 0px), 0) rotate(0deg); }
      50%      { transform: translate3d(-10px, calc(var(--pp-scroll-shift, 0px) + 22px), 0) rotate(-14deg); }
    }
    @keyframes pp-ambient-twinkle {
      0%, 100% { opacity: .25; }
      50%      { opacity: .8; }
    }

    /* Only worth showing once the margin is wide enough to hold a spark. */
    @media (max-width: 1600px) {
      .pp-ambient__spark--1, .pp-ambient__spark--4 { display: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 1340px) {
      .pp-ambient { display: none; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .pp-ambient__spark { animation: none !important; opacity: .35; }
    }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
